      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Here are the suspension parameters: Time: 2023-11-05T15:05:00Z, Alternative: Shuttle buses at 5th Ave and Broadway, Dispatcher: D789, Supervisor Approval: SA-5567, Confirmation: SUSP-INC5567.",
